    "description": "# BA-5: Termination Automation\n\n_Terminating a BA sets End Date and deactivates their Salesforce user record._\n\n### AUTOMATION\n\n* Terminating a BA sets End Date and deactivates their Salesforce user record\n\n* Lina Ceniccola, [49:21](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=2961): \"We are terminating them, are we talking about like, deactivating the user from Salesforce as well?\" Kobi Kunasekaran, [49:37](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=2977): \"Yes.\"\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* End Date should populate automatically off the termination action\n\n* See [BUILD-202 — Brand Ambassador: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693577680227/f/) (BA-1) for the End Date field itself.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: BA-5 (Brand Ambassador Record User Stories doc).\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc BA-5 — Brand Ambassador Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.g64hrhse8pog)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Lina Ceniccola, 49:21 (asks about deactivation)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=2961)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Kobi Kunasekaran, 49:37 (confirms)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=2977)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-202 — Brand Ambassador: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693577680227/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Brand Ambassador record documentation review.\n\n",
